lines+=['','## 2. Generalized family','', 'For a tiny coordinate-axis rectangle with bottom-left corner (u0,v0) and area δA, differentiate the displayed two components, form ad−bc, simplify symbolically, substitute the point, take absolute value, and select |J(u0,v0)|δA. The symbolic expression families are distinct templates; numerical points are variants.','', '## 3. Components and complete banks','', 'source-components.json maps each original displayed option one-to-one to abs(J(point))*r for its exact observed rational ratio r. Since isolated scalar values underdetermine a wrong-operation recipe, these ratios are explicitly replay-only proportional expression shapes with unresolved original intent. They do not claim recovered pedagogical intent, and are never selected by default. Both legacy complete banks are preserved separately; all raw fields are compared in validation.','', 'Normal authored banks use assessed method operations. Area bank: [C,C²,1/C,2C,C/2] (correct absolute factor, square, inverse, double, half). Determinant bank: [C,|ad+bc|,|ad|,|bc|,|2ad−bc|] at the same point. Select the entire profile first; reject the entire instance on zero/nonfinite scale, duplicate/equivalent members or nonnegative-domain failure. No pooled distractor replacement or random numerical noise. Determinant-operation banks are not registered for log_product, cos_sum, quotient_product, or sqrt_product because their fixed derivative relations force a collision for every eligible point; those families have the area-operation bank.','', '## 4. Reusable Markdown/value template','', 'Fixed: rectangle setting and shared source sentences, one selection radio with five coefficient δA answers, derivative matrix → ad−bc product → source-family symbolic simplification stages → point substitution → signed value → absolute area step. Variable: displayed component formulas, point, derivatives, determinant stages, substitution and bank values. Optional: explicit replay bank; moderate/hard small coefficient parameters. Domain constraints appear in generation metadata; source mathematical domains ensure a C¹ neighborhood at the point. Standard LaTeX normalizes Unicode and mathematical bitmap text without changing the complete mathematical object. No learner-facing error diagnoses are authored. One fixed solution is independent of chosen response.','', 'Observed solution prose is preserved verbatim; formula notation is normalized. All scalar simplification rows from each easy family are retained (including 2v−v and 2u²/v+u²/v); generated derivative matrix may use equivalent radical fractions. This is mathematical/layout fidelity, not a byte-identical solution-string claim. Canonical asset inspection is recorded in plot-extraction.md.','', 'Variation: easy has 11 original function forms with exact familiar evaluation families; moderate/hard use the bounds in classification.md. Canonical mathematical identity uses transformation, point and domain; presentation identity additionally includes complete bank, prompt, fixed solution and version. Changing seed/order alone preserves identity.']
